✅ Question 3: Orders Above Overall Average

### Why Subquery?
Window functions cannot be used directly in WHERE.

```sql
SELECT *
FROM (
    SELECT 
        orderid,
        sales,
        ROUND(AVG(sales) OVER(), 2) AS avg_sales_across_all_orders
    FROM orders
) t
WHERE sales > avg_sales_across_all_orders;
```

